#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_G9_NCM_Base
#: liminal-union/units/golems/b1-g9-ncm.cfg:46
msgid "The G9 Neural Curie Mainframe warform series stands among the most formidable ever wrought by the Union's artificers. Only the finest bound intellects are sealed within a Neural Curie Mainframe — the culmination of old golem-craft refined through generations of lawful inquiry. Their bound energy-core, the Curie radiant core, is an Arcanite-sealed vessel no larger than a watermelon, named for the first Union artificer to perfect its design. Though not swift, the sheer mass and energy density of a G9 NCM can endure grievous punishment in the field. These warforms wear down with time and must be maintained and recalibrated by artificers of the corps."
msgstr ""

