#: liminal-union/units/halfelven/maiden/a1-jaeger.cfg:55
msgid "A Maiden Corps Jaeger is part of the ranged infantry reserve of the Maiden Corps, trained to make skilled use of her wingsuit. Many of them are young mothers: raising and teaching the next generation, they naturally keep to archery practice at home rather than in a camp. In times of need they are called to service; otherwise they defend their own communities. They are equipped with the finest Arcanite-composite light armour the corps can provide, for no unit is held more beloved or revered. They operate in squads, harassing enemy infantry with a sustained hail of arrows from their short bows. They avoid individual close combat, preferring always to fight in concert. They have learned hard lessons against drake raids on their homeland: where Pyrite fire finds little purchase on draconic scale, their bodkin points bite deep."
