#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Sergeant_Base
#: liminal-union/units/halfelven/marines/a1-sergeant.cfg:54
msgid "A Marine Sergeant is part of the infantry reserve of the Marine Corps. Many of them are young fathers, raising and teaching the next generation; they naturally keep to combat training at home rather than in a standing camp. In times of need they may be drafted, or step forward on their own to defend their communities. The Sergeant is a swift all-round defender, armed with Arcanite-composite light armour, a hardened alu-bronze sword, and a precision sling. He is trained in both land and naval combat. Against forces unshielded by sorcerous protection — such as human or dunefolk levies — he holds a clear advantage. His Kryonite edge drinks the warmth from what it strikes, and bites deepest into the fire-blooded hides of draken."
msgstr ""

