msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=pierce
#: liminal-union/units/nations/dunefolk/sc0-dune-horseman.cfg:25
msgid "composite bow"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Dune_Horseman
#: liminal-union/units/nations/dunefolk/sc0-dune-horseman.cfg:34
msgid "Only the males of the dunefolk are allowed to ride horses on raids and in war. These young horsemen primarily function as scouts and messengers, or occasionally as supporting forces for weakened lines."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Herbalist, race=dunefolk
#: liminal-union/units/nations/dunefolk/sc1-herbalist.cfg:8
msgid "Dune Herbalist"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Herbalist, race=dunefolk
#: liminal-union/units/nations/dunefolk/sc1-herbalist.cfg:25
msgid "As those responsible for caring for the ill and wounded among the Dunefolk, herbalists possess both the medicinal skills to heal a variety of afflictions and the skill to seek and gather restorative herbs. Their motivations are many; some look to it as an adventure or as a steady source of pay while others feel it to be a duty to their society. No matter the reason, these healers are an invaluable part of Dunefolk society and are especially useful for their ability to administer quick treatments in the midst of battle or while traveling in the desert. Even among the nomadic Dunefolk, herbalists journey a great deal in search of the various flora and fauna that supply their work. Hardened by their travels, many of these men are even able to heal themselves."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Hashishine, race=dunefolk, gender=male
#: liminal-union/units/nations/dunefolk/sc2-hashishine.cfg:13
msgid "Dune Hashishi"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Hashishine, race=dunefolk, gender=male
#: liminal-union/units/nations/dunefolk/sc2-hashishine.cfg:31
msgid "Amongst the dunefolk developed a special unit, the Hashishi, the best assassinator. The Hashishi assailants are trained in techniques of hand-to-hand combat. Their most preferred weapon for a kill from behind are multiple knives dipped in poison. However, the Hashishi became best known for their excessive psychoactive drug abuse: hashish. The only downside of this practice in an army is, that by altering the visual, auditory, and olfactory senses, the drugs lead Hashishi sometimes to poison the false person, even merry comrades."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: liminal-union/units/nations/dunefolk/sc2-hashishine.cfg:38
msgid "blade"
msgstr ""

