#: liminal-union/units/nations/knalgan/f0-dwarvish-pilferer.cfg:19
msgid "Pilferers are impoverished individuals who can be found in the back alleys of any town. They subsist by petty crime and day labor, and even rats are always a welcome meal in such conditions."
msgstr ""

#. [female]: gender=female
#: liminal-union/units/nations/knalgan/f0-dwarvish-pilferer.cfg:51
